.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p
    Give admins and builders a single place to authenticate and call OurGruuv from outside the product
    (MCP tools and the mint Feedback Request HTTP endpoint) so automations can create the right answer links.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p
    Integrations here are
    %strong outbound call surfaces
    (you call OG). Product connects like Slack install live elsewhere.
    MCP/API access tokens bind to your teammate identity and authorize both MCP and Mint HTTP.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li
      %strong MCP/API access tokens
      — create first; one Bearer token for MCP and Mint.
    %li
      %strong MCP
      — preferred path for agents (Claude Connectors + OAuth, or Bearer token).
    %li
      %strong Mint Feedback Request link
      — HTTP POST for Zapier/scripts; returns
      %code answer_url
      and optionally
      %code public_answer_url
      \.
